<b>LayeredNetwork</b> - Layered queueing network model for client-server systems

<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2"><b>Constructor</b></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>model = LayeredNetwork(name)</code></td><td>Create a new layered queueing network</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>model = LayeredNetwork(name, filename)</code></td><td>Create and load from XML file</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2"><b>Static Methods</b></td></tr>
